WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.080 --> 00:01.280
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

3
00:01.300 --> 00:02.500
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

4
00:02.520 --> 00:03.720
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

5
00:03.740 --> 00:04.940
viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:05.210 --> 00:06.600
Come with me. Come on.

7
00:06.740 --> 00:07.290
Uh...

8
00:10.360 --> 00:11.960
Looks like he doesn't want to go with you.

9
00:11.980 --> 00:13.120
How is this any of your business?

10
00:13.300 --> 00:14.440
But he belongs to me.

11
00:18.520 --> 00:19.600
I hope this is clear now.

12
00:19.860 --> 00:20.680
Let's go home.

13
00:20.760 --> 00:21.400
Right,

14
00:21.610 --> 00:22.200
Kanthi.

15
00:22.220 --> 00:23.520
Are we that close now?

16
00:23.790 --> 00:25.320
I think it's adorable.

17
00:25.580 --> 00:27.320
Call me by my name more often.

18
00:27.520 --> 00:28.360
Help me!

19
00:29.390 --> 00:31.000
If Dad knows about this,

20
00:31.180 --> 00:32.080
you're in big trouble.

21
00:32.100 --> 00:32.960
If he does, then great.

22
00:33.040 --> 00:35.000
So he will know that... we love each other.

23
00:49.100 --> 00:50.700
I've made it to the office.

24
01:00.340 --> 01:02.340
I've made it to the university, too.

25
01:06.520 --> 01:08.920
Okay. I'll pick you up this evening

26
01:08.940 --> 01:10.300
to have dinner.

27
01:16.420 --> 01:18.140
It says he's read it.

28
01:18.700 --> 01:20.120
Why hasn't he replied yet?

29
01:29.060 --> 01:30.440
Yes, Kanthi?

30
01:30.460 --> 01:31.480
Gear.

31
01:31.660 --> 01:33.479
Why didn't you reply to my text?

32
01:34.080 --> 01:35.520
Huh, I'm sorry?

33
01:36.420 --> 01:37.979
Why haven't you replied

34
01:38.000 --> 01:39.120
to my dinner invitation?

35
01:40.940 --> 01:43.280
I thought you were just telling me.

36
01:44.460 --> 01:46.080
So, are you coming?

37
01:48.420 --> 01:49.560
Well, I...

38
01:50.500 --> 01:52.000
I didn't say no, did I?

39
01:57.720 --> 01:58.240
Mm.

40
01:58.800 --> 02:01.080
I'll pick you up after class.

41
02:02.320 --> 02:03.040
Right.

42
02:03.600 --> 02:04.900
That's all.

43
02:04.920 --> 02:05.880
Oh, wait.

44
02:06.700 --> 02:07.360
Yes?

45
02:08.360 --> 02:09.360
Uh...

46
02:14.240 --> 02:15.600
Work hard, okay?

47
02:16.320 --> 02:17.260
You've got this.

48
02:37.500 --> 02:41.460
♫I've been wondering♫

49
02:41.480 --> 02:45.579
♫What's it like to fall in love? (Do you know the answer?)♫

50
02:45.600 --> 02:47.579
♫Can't find an answer from ChatGPT♫

51
02:47.600 --> 02:49.720
♫Asking Gemini hasn't helped me at all♫

52
02:49.740 --> 02:53.920
♫Only you can help me find out how to love♫

53
02:53.940 --> 02:56.040
♫That's why I've been bothering you♫

54
02:56.060 --> 03:00.200
♫I'll be there no matter what you do, you do, you do♫

55
03:00.220 --> 03:02.860
♫Please, teach me♫

56
03:02.880 --> 03:07.160
♫What is love, love, love supposed to be?♫

57
03:07.180 --> 03:11.570
♫Can someone teach, teach me how it should be?♫

58
03:11.590 --> 03:16.320
♫I saw people in love, so I wanted some love for me♫

59
03:16.340 --> 03:20.190
♫Wanna love, love, so please help me♫

60
03:20.210 --> 03:21.480
♫Can you teach me?♫

61
03:44.320 --> 03:45.720
Jay, what's wrong?

62
03:46.350 --> 03:48.040
You look like you haven’t pooped in days.

63
03:48.440 --> 03:50.320
Let me know if something's on your mind.

64
03:54.800 --> 03:55.840
Hey, guys.

65
03:56.180 --> 03:57.280
What are you two discussing?

66
03:57.520 --> 04:00.280
Uh... nothing, actually.

67
04:02.400 --> 04:03.560
What about you?

68
04:04.360 --> 04:06.160
I heard...

69
04:06.580 --> 04:08.360
you were with Mr. Kanthi last night, weren't you?

70
04:09.420 --> 04:11.100
Well, well.

71
04:11.120 --> 04:13.560
You're looking so lively today.

72
04:13.760 --> 04:15.580
And you look so refreshed,

73
04:15.600 --> 04:17.260
like you've "drunk" a lot of it.

74
04:17.279 --> 04:18.600
Are you crazy?

75
04:19.279 --> 04:21.200
He just dropped me off at home.

76
04:22.120 --> 04:23.520
Nothing more than that.

77
04:24.120 --> 04:26.000
Mm... Okay.

78
04:26.280 --> 04:27.960
If you say so.

79
04:29.920 --> 04:31.100
Jay.

80
04:31.120 --> 04:33.080
You're not going live today?

81
04:33.560 --> 04:35.100
You haven't streamed in days,

82
04:35.120 --> 04:37.700
and... won't your engagement drop?

83
04:37.720 --> 04:39.240
Shit...

84
04:39.700 --> 04:40.880
I totally forgot.

85
04:41.440 --> 04:42.720
Well, then...

86
04:42.840 --> 04:44.280
How about this evening?

87
04:46.409 --> 04:47.090
Well?

88
04:47.700 --> 04:49.480
If it's this evening...

89
04:50.520 --> 04:51.820
I can't make it.

90
04:51.840 --> 04:52.640
Oh?

91
04:53.080 --> 04:54.000
Why not?

92
04:55.960 --> 04:57.040
Well...

93
05:00.480 --> 05:02.200
I have dinner plans with Kanthi.

94
05:02.280 --> 05:03.080
Dinner?!

95
05:03.200 --> 05:04.320
"Kanthi"?

96
05:04.840 --> 05:06.280
Why are you guys shouting?

97
05:09.320 --> 05:10.360
These days,

98
05:10.540 --> 05:14.360
you two are so close that you can just call him by his name?

99
05:15.500 --> 05:17.540
I'm sure he's hitting on you.

100
05:22.400 --> 05:23.920
I'm not really sure.

101
05:25.200 --> 05:26.220
I think he is, though.

102
05:26.240 --> 05:28.160
Why would he invite you to dinner, then?

103
05:28.440 --> 05:30.520
Maybe he's hitting on our friend because he's bored.

104
05:30.540 --> 05:31.520
Let's not forget that

105
05:31.760 --> 05:33.900
he's a total playboy.

106
05:33.920 --> 05:35.600
Aren't you being a little too negative here?

107
05:35.920 --> 05:37.080
Maybe...

108
05:37.480 --> 05:39.720
he just feels sorry for our friend.

109
05:40.240 --> 05:42.400
So you don't think he might actually like our friend here?

110
05:46.159 --> 05:48.500
Let me go! I told you to let go, Boss!

111
05:48.520 --> 05:49.159
Let go!

112
05:52.680 --> 05:53.200
Boss!

113
05:53.880 --> 05:55.380
What are you doing?!

114
05:55.400 --> 05:56.600
I told you to go away!

115
05:57.860 --> 05:59.060
I told you to get off me!

116
05:59.480 --> 06:00.400
Damn it!

117
06:01.520 --> 06:02.840
You'll run away if I do!

118
06:05.560 --> 06:06.240
Ow!

119
06:06.720 --> 06:07.760
Let me go!

120
06:08.240 --> 06:09.040
Let go!

121
06:10.520 --> 06:11.920
Don't do this.

122
06:12.440 --> 06:13.680
This changes nothing.

123
06:15.320 --> 06:16.540
Nothing?

124
06:17.200 --> 06:18.080
Do you know

125
06:18.440 --> 06:21.320
how miserable I was when you disappeared for five years?

126
06:22.820 --> 06:24.320
I asked myself every single day

127
06:24.850 --> 06:26.000
what I'd done wrong

128
06:27.280 --> 06:28.840
for you to disappear from my life.

129
06:29.520 --> 06:31.200
Do you know how agonizing it was

130
06:31.840 --> 06:33.600
to have a question with no answer?

131
06:41.640 --> 06:42.800
Boss.

132
06:45.720 --> 06:46.720
So, please,

133
06:49.159 --> 06:51.240
don't tell me to end things between us.

134
07:08.680 --> 07:09.680
Why aren't you struggling anymore?

135
07:12.680 --> 07:14.040
If having sex this time

136
07:15.300 --> 07:18.040
can atone for the wrongs I’ve done to you,

137
07:19.980 --> 07:20.920
I'll do it.

138
07:33.500 --> 07:34.720
I was just curious

139
07:36.080 --> 07:37.560
if you still loved me.

140
07:41.920 --> 07:43.240
But now I've got my answer.

141
07:46.760 --> 07:47.960
You can leave now.

142
07:50.380 --> 07:51.940
I won't bother you anymore.

143
07:55.420 --> 07:56.200
Boss.

144
08:02.520 --> 08:03.360
Leave!

145
08:57.220 --> 08:58.880
And what's your answer?

146
09:04.480 --> 09:05.360
Shin...

147
09:54.140 --> 09:54.920
Boss.

148
09:55.720 --> 09:56.600
You're awake?

149
10:08.640 --> 10:10.280
I thought you'd already left me.

150
10:11.500 --> 10:12.920
If I were going to leave,

151
10:13.480 --> 10:15.120
I would've already done it last night.

152
10:18.260 --> 10:19.480
Don't leave me again.

153
10:23.120 --> 10:23.840
Mm.

154
10:32.000 --> 10:32.720
Move it.

155
10:33.480 --> 10:34.840
Don't forget the other tasks too.

156
10:42.720 --> 10:44.320
Sorry if I'm prying,

157
10:44.800 --> 10:46.960
but you're not going to reply to your boyfriend's texts?

158
10:51.000 --> 10:51.760
Mm.

159
10:53.360 --> 10:55.120
Until he decides

160
10:56.280 --> 10:57.480
what to do next.

161
11:00.800 --> 11:02.360
If he's ready to go public,

162
11:04.160 --> 11:05.240
I'll keep this going.

163
11:06.340 --> 11:07.680
If he isn't,

164
11:11.440 --> 11:12.520
I'll end it.

165
11:13.520 --> 11:14.560
You're going to break up?

166
11:16.940 --> 11:17.720
Mm.

167
11:22.440 --> 11:24.240
Just talk things through calmly, okay?

168
11:24.790 --> 11:26.880
You can always talk things over with me.

169
11:28.780 --> 11:29.660
Thanks.

170
11:42.640 --> 11:44.440
Do you want me to wait for Mr. Kanthi with you?

171
11:46.040 --> 11:47.040
No need.

172
11:51.920 --> 11:52.800
Guys.

173
11:53.080 --> 11:53.840
I have to go now.

174
11:54.080 --> 11:54.820
Right.

175
12:03.360 --> 12:04.480
What's up with him?

176
12:05.360 --> 12:06.260
I don't know.

177
12:06.280 --> 12:07.520
Maybe he's...

178
12:07.960 --> 12:10.200
going through a rough patch in his relationship?

179
12:10.680 --> 12:11.840
Jay already has a boyfriend?

180
12:16.100 --> 12:17.160
I don't know.

181
12:17.920 --> 12:18.960
I was just saying.

182
12:19.780 --> 12:20.840
I'll be going, then.

183
12:21.480 --> 12:22.320
- Bye. - Mm.

184
12:22.560 --> 12:23.880
- Take care. - See you.

185
12:37.320 --> 12:38.560
Did I keep you waiting?

186
12:39.600 --> 12:40.360
Oh!

187
12:40.780 --> 12:43.360
Kanthi. You scared me.

188
12:44.240 --> 12:45.400
Why?

189
12:46.000 --> 12:47.780
We've done much more than this before.

190
12:48.800 --> 12:50.320
Oh, you!

191
12:54.360 --> 12:56.040
Come on. Let's go.

192
12:56.680 --> 12:58.960
I made a reservation for us. We're running late.

193
13:08.680 --> 13:09.480
Come.

194
13:15.440 --> 13:16.380
Yes, Grandpa.

195
13:16.400 --> 13:17.400
What's up?

196
13:19.540 --> 13:20.320
Huh?

197
13:21.060 --> 13:22.040
I'm sorry?

198
13:28.240 --> 13:30.720
Call me if anything comes up, okay? [Emergency Room]

199
13:32.360 --> 13:33.140
Grandpa!

200
13:33.160 --> 13:34.380
- Gear? - Hello.

201
13:34.400 --> 13:35.720
How's Granddad?

202
13:36.100 --> 13:37.900
He's still in the emergency room.

203
13:37.920 --> 13:39.280
I don't know how he's doing right now.

204
13:40.460 --> 13:42.620
And... how did he fall?

205
13:43.320 --> 13:45.400
He took the beer cartons into the bar himself

206
13:45.420 --> 13:47.120
without waiting for the workers.

207
13:48.240 --> 13:51.440
I told him not to, but he wouldn't listen.

208
13:52.420 --> 13:55.240
It's all my fault.

209
13:55.820 --> 13:59.780
If I’d kept a closer eye on him,

210
14:00.080 --> 14:02.200
he wouldn't have carried the beer cartons himself.

211
14:05.520 --> 14:07.360
This isn't your fault, Grandpa.

212
14:08.400 --> 14:09.520
Don't be too harsh on yourself.

213
14:10.040 --> 14:10.960
He's right.

214
14:11.220 --> 14:13.560
Besides, Granddad Keat is really tough.

215
14:13.760 --> 14:15.360
He'll be okay.

216
14:25.340 --> 14:26.840
Are you a relative of Mr. Keatprawat?

217
14:27.220 --> 14:28.000
Yes.

218
14:28.600 --> 14:30.380
How's he doing?

219
14:33.280 --> 14:35.840
Fortunately, it's just fatigue.

220
14:35.860 --> 14:37.280
Nothing serious.

221
14:37.660 --> 14:39.840
The doctor says he only needs to stay overnight for an IV drip.

222
14:40.020 --> 14:41.360
Then he can go home tomorrow.

223
14:43.040 --> 14:44.980
You can stop worrying now, Grandpa.

224
14:45.440 --> 14:49.160
Once he wakes up, I'll have a word with him

225
14:49.600 --> 14:51.160
so he won't be so stubborn next time.

226
14:55.080 --> 14:56.200
I think...

227
14:56.720 --> 14:58.320
you should go home and rest up.

228
14:58.800 --> 15:01.120
I'll stay here tonight.

229
15:02.600 --> 15:03.700
It's okay.

230
15:04.320 --> 15:06.840
Let me stay with him.

231
15:13.320 --> 15:14.240
Kanthi.

232
15:15.480 --> 15:17.280
Drive him home, will you?

233
15:18.760 --> 15:19.660
Absolutely.

234
15:22.120 --> 15:23.200
Let's go, Gear.

235
15:24.120 --> 15:25.320
But...

236
15:25.980 --> 15:27.480
Let him drive you home.

237
15:28.040 --> 15:30.320
I'm fine. Don't worry.

238
15:37.020 --> 15:37.920
Then...

239
15:38.720 --> 15:40.080
I'll head home first.

240
15:41.160 --> 15:42.440
But if anything comes up,

241
15:42.620 --> 15:44.360
you can always call me.

242
15:45.460 --> 15:46.600
Tomorrow,

243
15:47.160 --> 15:49.120
I'll come and take you two home.

244
15:56.400 --> 15:57.240
Let's go.

245
15:58.120 --> 15:59.580
- Bye-bye, Grandpa. - See you, Grandpa.

246
16:24.480 --> 16:25.840
Are you hungry, Gear?

247
16:28.080 --> 16:29.800
No, I'm not.

248
16:31.180 --> 16:32.520
Not even in the slightest?

249
16:33.580 --> 16:34.280
Yes.

250
16:34.920 --> 16:36.400
I'm starving, though.

251
16:36.820 --> 16:38.280
Can we grab something first?

252
16:38.900 --> 16:40.120
It's up to you.

253
16:40.340 --> 16:41.520
I'm fine with anything.

254
16:41.980 --> 16:43.320
Then... let's go.

255
16:43.580 --> 16:45.020
I'll take you to a good restaurant.

256
16:47.600 --> 16:48.640
[Tanwarin Hospital]

257
16:48.660 --> 16:50.660
[Rose Club]

258
17:04.640 --> 17:05.400
Nu.

259
17:06.720 --> 17:08.079
Please stop being upset with me.

260
17:09.480 --> 17:10.480
I'm sorry

261
17:10.960 --> 17:13.319
that I said bad things to you...

262
17:13.900 --> 17:15.520
I didn't mean it.

263
17:17.220 --> 17:18.880
Can we get back together, Nu?

264
17:29.420 --> 17:30.320
Nu.

265
17:31.880 --> 17:33.560
Can you stop ignoring me?

266
17:34.560 --> 17:36.800
When you don't reply to my messages for even a day,

267
17:37.360 --> 17:39.320
I feel like I'm going to die.

268
17:39.740 --> 17:41.020
And back then...

269
17:41.040 --> 17:42.680
I really didn't mean it.

270
17:45.340 --> 17:46.560
So, please, Nu.

271
17:47.270 --> 17:48.760
Can we get back together?

272
17:56.160 --> 17:57.120
I love you.

273
18:02.920 --> 18:04.320
I love you, Nu.

274
18:18.680 --> 18:19.680
Are you sure

275
18:20.280 --> 18:21.320
you love me?

276
18:22.080 --> 18:23.160
Of course.

277
18:24.040 --> 18:25.760
If I didn't,

278
18:26.240 --> 18:27.880
I wouldn't be here begging you like this.

279
18:35.400 --> 18:36.560
Please... Nu.

280
18:38.080 --> 18:39.160
Let's make up.

281
18:44.840 --> 18:46.240
If you really love me,

282
18:48.340 --> 18:49.400
prove it.

283
18:54.360 --> 18:55.120
Fine.

284
18:55.720 --> 18:56.840
Whatever you want me to do,

285
18:57.300 --> 18:58.180
just tell me.

286
19:06.480 --> 19:07.680
You said it yourself.

287
19:15.040 --> 19:15.900
Come here.

288
19:16.840 --> 19:17.580
Here.

289
19:27.500 --> 19:28.360
Kiss me.

290
19:30.290 --> 19:31.050
Huh?

291
19:33.100 --> 19:34.440
I said kiss me.

292
19:37.360 --> 19:38.560
Right here?

293
19:38.860 --> 19:39.680
Yeah!

294
19:41.640 --> 19:43.440
If you dare kiss me in front of other people,

295
19:44.700 --> 19:47.600
I'll believe that you really love me.

296
19:50.300 --> 19:51.440
But your club has a rule that

297
19:51.620 --> 19:53.520
employees aren't allowed to date customers.

298
19:53.540 --> 19:54.700
I don't care!

299
19:54.720 --> 19:55.780
It's your choice:

300
19:57.660 --> 19:59.220
either kiss me right here,

301
20:02.300 --> 20:03.500
or we're breaking up.

302
20:04.420 --> 20:05.340
Nu.

303
20:06.620 --> 20:08.140
Don't let your emotions get the better of you.

304
20:08.620 --> 20:09.660
I'm begging you.

305
20:10.680 --> 20:12.220
It's because I always rely on reason and logic

306
20:14.260 --> 20:16.460
that I’m nothing more than a “tripod” in your life.

307
20:18.880 --> 20:19.800
Well?

308
20:21.280 --> 20:22.420
Are you going to kiss me?

309
20:36.040 --> 20:37.960
Oh, are you Jay?

310
20:39.620 --> 20:40.120
Yes.

311
20:40.140 --> 20:41.560
Hey, can I take a selfie with you?

312
20:41.580 --> 20:42.680
I'm your biggest fan.

313
20:42.720 --> 20:43.750
- Please. - Over here, please.

314
20:43.770 --> 20:44.450
- The lighting is good here. - Sure thing.

315
20:44.470 --> 20:46.580
- This spot should work. - Sure. No problem.

316
20:47.300 --> 20:48.440
Smile, please.

317
20:48.820 --> 20:50.740
Who are you with tonight?

318
20:51.080 --> 20:52.520
I'm here by myself, actually.

319
20:52.980 --> 20:55.100
- Oh. - What about Gear and Pond?

320
20:55.120 --> 20:56.760
- Are they... - They're not here tonight.

321
20:56.780 --> 20:57.800
I'm here all by myself.

322
20:57.820 --> 20:59.320
Oh, okay.

323
20:59.560 --> 21:00.680
I'm a huge fan of yours.

324
21:00.700 --> 21:01.600
- Oh, thank you. - I really like you.

325
21:01.620 --> 21:03.200
- One with a peace sign. - I really do. You're so handsome.

326
21:04.910 --> 21:06.500
- Gosh, so handsome. - Smile.

327
21:07.580 --> 21:08.900
Okay.

328
21:09.620 --> 21:11.080
- Thank you. - Thank you so much.

329
21:11.100 --> 21:11.880
- Thank you. - Thank you.

330
21:11.900 --> 21:13.200
- Thank you. - Alright.

331
21:40.140 --> 21:40.780
Here.

332
21:41.220 --> 21:42.320
