Can we get back together?

667
49:51.200 --> 49:52.160
Gear.

668
49:56.280 --> 49:57.120
Kanthi?

669
50:15.290 --> 50:16.080
Gear.

670
50:16.100 --> 50:16.960
I'm happy

671
50:17.160 --> 50:18.960
you're still using the bag I bought for you.

672
50:19.000 --> 50:20.080
You're fucking happy, huh?

673
50:20.180 --> 50:21.320
Don't touch what's mine.

674
50:22.210 --> 50:23.400
Gear and I used to love each other.

675
50:23.440 --> 50:24.740
You're the one who came after!

676
50:24.760 --> 50:25.920
Hey, Kanthi!

677
50:26.030 --> 50:27.240
I'll buy you a new one.

678
50:27.330 --> 50:30.600
♫Happy birthday to you♫

679
50:30.700 --> 50:35.040
♫Happy birthday, happy birthday♫

680
50:35.510 --> 50:36.520
Thank you, Gear,

681
50:36.680 --> 50:37.840
for hosting my birthday party.

682
50:40.400 --> 50:42.040
And how did you know today's my birthday?

683
50:59.790 --> 51:03.200
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

684
51:03.220 --> 51:07.370
♫What love can be♫

685
51:07.390 --> 51:09.500
♫"Love" used to mean nothing♫

686
51:09.530 --> 51:14.880
♫Now it's starting to have meaning♫

687
51:14.900 --> 51:18.420
♫The love you gave me♫

688
51:18.440 --> 51:22.820
♫Was so fulfilling, helped me realize♫

689
51:22.840 --> 51:30.510
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫
